      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每轮攀塔都会生成新的谜题楼层，在随机布局中躲过法师手下的围堵",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Choose from a colorful cast of characters and solve procedurally-generated floors of puzzles to survive the onslaught of Bobo's minions blocking your path!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3729890/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "角色拥有独立初始道具与武器池，沿途神器再与武器和玩法形成协同",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Every character has their own starter items and weapon pools to work with throughout each run. Weapons can increase your range, deal physical or magic damage, launch projectiles, and/or even be upgraded! Don't forget to collect artifacts along the way to build synergy with your weapons and play style!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3729890/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
